Falsifies `designware_mobile_storage::proofs::reading_a_block_never_writes_the_card_or_leaves_the_region`.

The defect: the direction bit of the command word is inverted, so a read goes to the card as a
write, and the card is overwritten with whatever the region holds.

Expected to fail: `assert!(host.registers_mut().write_commands == 0)`.

